# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo AND in working trees.
# Prettier enforces LF (`endOfLine: "lf"` default); without this file a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true produces CRLF everywhere and
# `prettier --check .` fails on every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch line endings
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
